# NOTEBOOKS DIRECTORY MANIFESTO
# Standard: Lab-Experiment-v1.2

## Contents
- `01_EDA.ipynb`: Analysis of distributions and skewness.
- `02_Feature_Engineering.ipynb`: Testing new synthetic features.
- `03_Hyperparameter_Tuning.ipynb`: Optuna/GridSearch results.

## Policy
- Keep notebooks clean and "Restart & Run All" verified.
- Use Relative paths (e.g., `../data/`) to ensure portability.

